WEBVTT

00:13:27.636 --> 00:13:30.806
Now, you might not have a leg
that looks like this.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.851
But I’ll bet you’ve got some scars.

00:13:34.643 --> 00:13:36.478
And my hope for you is this.

00:13:37.437 --> 00:13:38.605
Look at them.

00:13:39.314 --> 00:13:40.566
Own them.

00:13:41.316 --> 00:13:45.779
They're the best reminder you'll ever have
that there's a whole world out there.

00:13:46.321 --> 00:13:49.157
And we've got a whole lot
of living left to do.

00:13:49.199 --> 00:13:50.367
Thank you.

00:13:50.409 --> 00:13:55.789
(Applause)